    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of September 25, 2020\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 25.09.2020)\n\nMARRIAGE REGISTRATION (AMENDMENT)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Premitha Bandara Tennakoon, M.P. for Matale District\n\nto amend the Marriage Registration Ordinance\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\n(Private Member's Bill)\n\nMarriage Registration (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE MARRIAGE REGISTRATION ORDINANCE\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Marriage Registration(Amendment) Act, No. of 2020.\n\n2.The Long title of the Marriage Registration OrdinanceNo. 19 of 1907 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipleenactment\u201d) is amended to remove the words \u201cOTHERTHAN THE MARRIAGES OF MUSLIMS AND\u201d therein.\n\n3.In the Section 64 substitute the interpretation of\u201cmarriage\u201d with the following :- \u201cmarriage\u201d means, \u201canymarriage contracted under this ordinance between any twopersons who have reached the age of 18 and above\u201d.\n\n4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendmentof the longtitle of theprincipleenactment.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\nSubstitute theinterpretationof \u201cmarriage\u201din theSection 64 ofthe principalenactment.\n\n15\n\n2Marriage Registration (Amendment)\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
  },
