    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of October 02, 2020\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 07.10.2020)\n\nSHOP AND OFFICE EMPLOYEES (REGULATION OFEMPLOYMENT AND REMUNERATION)(AMENDMENT)\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Labour\n\nto amend the Shop and Office Employees(Regulation of Employment and Remuneration) Act (Chapter 129)\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 10 of the Shop and Office Employees (Regulationof Employment and Remuneration) Act (Chapter 129) and the legal effect of the sectionas amended is to increase the employable age from fourteen years to sixteen years.\n\nShop and Office Employees (Regulation ofEmployment and Remuneration) (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 32/2018\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE SHOP AND OFFICE EMPLOYEES (REGULATION\n\nOF EMPLOYMENT AND REMUNERATION) ACT (CHAPTER 129)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Shop and OfficeEmployees (Regulation of Employment and Remuneration)(Amendment) Act, No. of 2020.\n\n2.Section 10 of the Shop and Office Employees(Regulation of Employment and Remuneration) Act (Chapter129) is hereby amended by the substitution for the words\u201cfourteen years\u201d of the words \u201csixteen years\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendmentof section 10of Chapter129.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\n2Shop and Office Employees (Regulation ofEmployment and Remuneration) (Amendment)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
