    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. Premitha Bandara Tennakoon,M.P. for Matale District on 02nd of December 2020\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 23, 2020)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 18]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nMARRIAGE REGISTRATION (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Marriage Registration Ordinance\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nMarriage Registration (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE MARRIAGE REGISTRATION ORDINANCE\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Marriage Registration(Amendment) Act, No. of 2020.\n\n2.The long title of the Marriage Registration OrdinanceNo. 19 of 1907 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is amended to remove the words \u201cOTHERTHAN THE MARRIAGES OF MUSLIMS AND\u201d therein.\n\n3.In the Section 64 substitute the interpretation of\u201cmarriage\u201d with the following :- \u201cmarriage\u201d means, \u201canymarriage contracted under this ordinance between a manand a woman who have reached the age of 18 and above\u201d.\n\n4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendmentof the longtitle of theprincipalenactment.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\nSubstitute theinterpretationof \u201cmarriage\u201din theSection 64 ofthe principalenactment.\n\n2Marriage Registration (Amendment)\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
