    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 25]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. ( Ven.) Athuraliye Rathana Thero, M.P. on 09th of February, 2021\n\n(Published in the Gazette on February 1, 2021)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nMARRIAGES (GENERAL) (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Marriages (General) Ordinance No. 19 of 1907\n\n1Marriages (General) (Amendment)\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE MARRIAGES (GENERAL)ORDINANCE NO. 19 OF 1907\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Marriages (General)(Amendment) Act, No. of 2021.\n\n2.The Preamble of the Principle enactment is herebyamended by deletion of the words \u201cother than the marriagesof Muslims\u201d.\n\n3.Notwithstanding anything contrary to the provisionsof the Principle enactment or the provisions of any other law,the Marriages (General) Ordinance No. 19 of 1907 shallprevail.\n\n4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title\n\n5\n\n10\n\nRepeal andsavings\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\nAmendmentof thepreamble ofthe Principleenactment\n\n2Marriages (General) (Amendment)\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
