    "md5": "dd695ef9b06d0012e0f1102f1d1a24f2",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2023,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sathya Sri GhanapathiBhakthi Jana Sewa Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of2021.\n\n(2) The Corporation shall be deemed to be a VoluntarySocial Service Organization within the meaning and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Service Organizations\n\nIncorporationof the SathyaSriGhanapathiBhakthi JanaSewaFoundation\n\n30\n\n2Sathya Sri Ghanapathi Bhakthi Jana Sewa Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the Corporation.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to reconstruct the Sathya Sri Jungle GhanapathiTemple and its premises;\n\n(b)to construct a God\u2019s Altar for rituals;\n\n(c)to construct a Pilgrims\u2019 Rest and other infrastructurefacilities to provide free accommodation to thedevotees;\n\n(d)to conduct vocational training to the unemployedyouths through the well-wishers attached to theTemple and to direct them for employmentopportunities.\n\n4.The objects of the Corporation shall be carried out insuch manner so as not to create any conflict between thework of the Corporation and any work being carried outsimultaneously by any Ministry or Department of theGovernment or of any Provincial Council.\n\n5.(1) Subject to the provisions of this Act themanagement and administration of the affairs of theCorporation shall be carried out by a Board of Management(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cBoard\u201d) consisting of suchnumber of office bearers as may be specified by the rulesmade under section 7.\n\n(2)(a) The Board of the Foundation holding office on theday immediately preceding the date of commencement ofthis Act, shall function as the Board of the Corporation untilthe first Board is appointed or elected in the manner providedfor by rules made under section 7."
  },
