    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Roshan RanasingheJanasahana Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2021.\n\nIncorporationof theRoshanRanasingheJanasahanaFoundation\n\n2Roshan Ranasinghe JanasahanaFoundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)implementing diverse programmes for thepropagation of Buddhism, Catholicism, Hinduismand Islam among the people and extending as muchsupport as possible for their promotion andestablishing societies and organizations with theparticipation of the devotees of such religiouscenters with a view to building a virtuous andpeaceful society valuing time honored customs andrituals;\n\n(b)to encourage farmers engaged in traditional andexport agricultural activities and to carry outvarious awareness programmes for them;\n\n(c)providing relief and welfare services in naturaldisasters, distress and unexpected incidents;\n\n(d)to provide or arrange to provide vocational trainingand assistance to disadvantaged young persons toengage in self-employment or to secure otheremployment;\n\n(e)to engage in any industry or trade or any export orimport business and to aid or assist persons tocommence and operate agricultural, industrial andcommercial ventures and to undertake trainingprogrammes and extension of services and toorganize propaganda activities relating to thetransfer of technology;\n\n(f)setting up welfare insurance schemes for themembers of the Foundation;\n\n(g)to do all other things necessary or expedient for thecarrying out of the objects of the Corporation; and\n\n(h)to liaise and co-ordinate with other local and foreigninstitutions which have similar objects.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation\n\n3Roshan Ranasinghe JanasahanaFoundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
