    "md5": "bae7dc1feafdf5b5a3208aa7a1e49714",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1626,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 36]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. Uddika Premarathne, M. P. for Anuradhapura District on 23rd of March, 2021\n\n(Published in the Gazette on March 15, 2021)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSETHSADA YOGA NIKETHANAYEKARYA BARAYA (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Sethsada Yoga Nikethanaye Karya Baraya\n\n1Sethsada Yoga NikethanayeKarya Baraya (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\nIncorporationof SethsadaYogaNikethanayeKarya Baraya\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SETHSADA YOGA NIKETHANAYEKARYA BARAYA\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the\u201cSethsada Yoga Nikethanaye Karya Baraya\u201d has heretoforebeen formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and matters connectedwith the said Baraya Foundation according to the rules agreedto by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sethsada YogaNikethanaye Karya Baraya (Incorporation) Act, No. 2021."
  },
