    "chunk_size_bytes": 1951,
    "chunk_text": "Be it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the \u201cBalapitiya SriRahularama Purana Viharastha Samanera AkalpaSangwardena Bikshu Vidyalaya (Incorporation) Act, No. of2021.\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\nIncorporationof theBalapitiya SriRahularamaPuranaViharasthaSamaneraAkalpaSangwardenaBikshuVidyalaya\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n2Balapitiya Sri Rahularama Purana ViharasthaSamanera Akalpa Sangwardena Bikshu Vidyalaya(Incorporation)\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a) including the course of conduct of a noviceSamanera Bhikku, as a life practice;\n\n(b) writing the basic elements of novice Samaneramonk;\n\n(c) giving knowledge on customs of partaking alms,pindapatha, (gathering alms by visiting households),bathing and sleeping;\n\n(d) developing precise ways of performing services tothe Buddha, Bodhi Pooja and uttering Pin Wakya;\n\n(e) to provide basic knowledge of Sinhala, Pali,Samaskrit, Tamil and English Language;\n\n(f) giving an elementary knowledge of life of theBuddha and set of historic affairs in the BuddhistSasana (selected); and\n\n(g) to promote an implement projects those arebeneficial to mankind.\n\n4.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject to theother provisions of this Act and the rules in force for the timebeing of the Corporation be managed by a Committee ofManagement consisting of Chairman, Secretary, Treasurerand another nine members elected in accordance with suchrules.\n\n(2) The first Committee of Management shall consist ofthe members of the Committee of Management holding officeon the day immediately preceding the date of commencementof this Act.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation\n\n3Balapitiya Sri Rahularama Purana ViharasthaSamanera Akalpa Sangwardena Bikshu Vidyalaya(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
  },
