    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of April 09, 2021\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 15.04.2021)\n\nCHARTERED INSTITUTE OF TRANSPORT OFSRI LANKA (INCORPORATION) (AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\nto amend the Chartered Institute of Transport of Sri Lanka(Incorporation) Act, No. 8 of 2000\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. (Dr.) (Ms.) Harini Amarasuriya, M.P.\n\nChartered Institute of Transport of Sri Lanka(Incorporation) (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE CHARTERED INSTITUTE OF TRANSPORT OFSRI LANKA (INCORPORATION) ACT, NO. 8 OF 2000\n\nWHEREAS the Corporate members of the Chartered Instituteof Transport of Sri Lanka incorporated under the CharteredInstitute of Transport of Sri Lanka Act, No. 08 of 2000 haspassed a resolution to amend the name of said Institute:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Institute, for the purpose of giveneffect to the said resolution, has applied to change the nameof such Institute and it will be expedient to grant suchapplication:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Chartered Institute ofTransport of Sri Lanka (Incorporation) (Amendment) Act,No. of 2021.\n\n2.In every context in which the Chartered Institute ofTransport of Sri Lanka is mentioned (whether by that nameor by the name \u201cChartered Institute of Transport of Sri Lanka\u201dor by the abbreviation \u201cInstitute\u201d) in the Institute of CharteredInstitute of Transport of Sri Lanka Act or any notice or otherdocument issued under that Act, there shall, unless the contextotherwise requires, be substituted for the expressions\u201cChartered Institute of Transport of Sri Lanka\u201d, the expression\u201cChartered Institute of Logistics and Transport of Sri Lanka\u201d."
  },
