    "chunk_size_bytes": 1098,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Chartered Institute ofTransport of Sri Lanka (Incorporation) (Amendment) Act,No. of 2021.\n\n3.Every contract, agreement or other instrument ordocument whatsoever made, issued or executed prior to thedate of commencement of this Act, by or in favour of the\u201cChartered Institute of Transport of Sri Lanka\u201d shall bedeemed on and after the date of commencement of this Act tobe and to have been made issued or executed by or in favourof the expression \u201cChartered Institute of Logistics andTransport of Sri Lanka\u201d.\n\nShort title\n\nPreamble\n\nGeneralamendmentto Act, No. 8of 2000\n\n25\n\nSaving forcontracts etc\n\n30\n\n2Chartered Institute of Transport of Sri Lanka(Incorporation) (Amendment)\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\n4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nChartered Institute of Transport of Sri Lanka(Incorporation) (Amendment)3\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
