    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 49]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nFISCAL MANAGEMENT (RESPONSIBILITY)(AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Fiscal Management (Responsibility) Act, No. 3 of 2003\n\nPresented by the Prime Minister and Minister of Finance, Minister ofBuddhasasana, Religious & Cultural Affairs and Minister ofUrban Development & Housing on 05th of May, 2021\n\n(Published in the Gazette on April 28, 2021)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 3 of the Fiscal Management (Responsibility)Act, No. 3 of 2003 by amending paragraphs (e) and (f) thereof and the legal effect of thissection as amended is to revise the objectives underlying responsible fiscal management\u2013\n\n(a)by increasing the guarantee limit specified in paragraph (e) up to 15 percent;and\n\n(b)by moving the established debt to gross domestic product target, to year 2030.\n\n1Fiscal Management (Responsibility)(Amendment)\n\nShort titleand date ofoperation\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 7/2021\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE FISCAL MANAGEMENT (RESPONSIBILITY)ACT, NO. 3 OF 2003\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Fiscal Management(Responsibility) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2021 and shallbe deemed to have come into operation on January 1, 2021.\n\n2.Section 3 of the Fiscal Management (Responsibility)Act, No. 3 of 2003 is hereby amended as follows:-\n\n(a) in paragraph (e) of that section, by the substitution,for the words \u201cten per centum;\u201d of the words \u201cfifteenper centum;\u201d; and\n\n(b) in paragraph (f) of that section, by the substitution,for the words and figures \u201cJanuary 1, 2020\u201d of thewords and figures \u201c January 1, 2030\u201d."
