    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of May 13, 2021\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 20.05.2021)\n\nCORONAVIRUS DISEASE 2019 (COVID - 19)(TEMPORARY PROVISIONS)\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Justice\n\nPrice : Rs. 28.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nto make temporary provisions in relation to situations where persons wereunable to perfom certain actions required by law to be performed withinthe prescribed time periods due to Covid - 19 circumstances; to assignalternative courts where a court cannot function due to Covid - 19circumstances; to conduct court proceedings using remote communicationtechnology to facilitate the control of coronavirus disease 2019(Covid - 19); to grant relief in relation to parties to certain contracts whowere unable to perform contractual obligations due to Covid - 19circumstances and for matters connected therewith or incidental thereto\n\n1Coronavirus Disease 2019 (Covid - 19)(Temporary Provisions)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nShort title,duration andextension ofoperation ofthe Act\n\nL.D.-O 19/2020\n\nAN ACT TO MAKE TEMPORARY PROVISIONS IN RELATION TO SITUATIONS\n\nWHERE PERSONS WERE UNABLE TO PERFOM CERTAIN ACTIONS\n\nREQUIRED BY LAW TO BE PERFORMED WITHIN THE PRESCRIBED TIME\n\nPERIODS DUE TO COVID - 19 CIRCUMSTANCES; TO ASSIGN ALTERNATIVE\n\nCOURTS WHERE A COURT CANNOT FUNCTION DUE TO COVID - 19\n\nCIRCUMSTANCES; TO CONDUCT COURT PROCEEDINGS USING REMOTE\n\nCOMMUNICATION TECHNOLOGY TO FACILITATE THE CONTROL OF\n\nCORONAVIRUS DISEASE 2019 (COVID - 19); TO GRANT RELIEF IN\n\nRELATION TO PARTIES TO CERTAIN CONTRACTS WHO WERE UNABLE TO\n\nPERFORM CONTRACTUAL OBLIGATIONS DUE TO COVID - 19\n\nCIRCUMSTANCES AND FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR\n\nINCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-"
