    "chunk_size_bytes": 1772,
    "chunk_text": "2.(1) From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons now are members of the MilcoMilk Producers\u2019 Foundation (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cFoundation\u201d) and shall hereafter be admitted as members ofthe body corporate hereby constituted shall have perpetualsuccession under the name and style of the Milco MilkProducers\u2019 Foundation (hereafter referred to as the \u201cbodycorporate\u201d) and by that name may sue and be sued with fullpower and authority to have, and use a common seal andalter the same at its pleasure.\n\nShort title\n\n10\n\nPreamble\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nIncorporationof the MilcoMilkProducers\u2019Foundation\n\n30\n\nMilco Milk Producers\u2019 Foundation(Incorporation)2\n\n3.The general objects for which the body corporate isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a) to develop milk production as a successful economicventure and thereby to uplift the living standards ofmembers of the Foundation and promote economicdevelopment;\n\n(b) to collaborate with the Milco Private Limited for thebenefit of the members of the Foundation;\n\n(c) to formulate the necessary structure for themembership to receive benefits through itsparticipation in the promotion of local milk industry;\n\n(d) to take all necessary measures to produce pure andhigh quality milk;\n\n(e) to provide necessary advice and assistance to themembers to ensure and economically successful andeffective milk production; and\n\n(f) to provide necessary facilities for the sale of milkthrough Milco Private Limited.\n\n4.The objects of the body corporate shall be carried outin such manner so as not to create any conflict between thework of the body corporate and any work being carried outsimultaneously by any Ministry or Department of theGovernment or of any Provincial Council."
