    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Arundika FernandoRelief Services and Godfrey Fernando Memorial Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2021.\n\nIncorporationof theArundikaFernandoReliefServices andGodfreyFernandoMemorialFoundation\n\n2Arundika Fernando Relief Services andGodfrey Fernando Memorial Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)supporting the establisment of pre-school andmaking arrangements to ensure upliftment ofchildren by devising programmes to develop them;\n\n(b)introducing technical expertise and skills requiredto successfully run industries related to fisheries,agriculture and commercial business, organizingtraining workshops, providing financial assistanceto whatever possible manner and making availablevarious facilities connected thereto;\n\n(c)identifying local artists in order to preservetraditional cultural arts and conducting assessmentof them at various levels to encourage them andmaking arrangements to obtain their maximumcontribution towards the preservation of traditionalcultural arts by offering them various facilitiesrequired by them;\n\n(d)effecting betterment of the lives of farmers andfishermen by promoting small and medium levelindustries and expanding infrastructure facilities;\n\n(e)making arrangements towards the promotion of allplaces of religious worship and carrying out relevantprogrammes to enhance mutual understandingamong followers of various religions aimed atreligious cohabitation;\n\n(f)carrying out any other activity that is deemednecessary for the achievement of the objectives ofthe Foundation; and\n\n(g)working closely with local and foreignorganizations with similar objectives of theFoundation.\n\n30\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation\n\n3Arundika Fernando Relief Services andGodfrey Fernando Memorial Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25"
