    "chunk_size_bytes": 1723,
    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of July 22, 2021\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 28.07.2021)\n\nINSTITUTE OF SPORT FOR PEACE, EDUCATION,EMPOWERMENT AND DEVELOPMENT (SPEED)(INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Institute of Sport for Peace, Education,Empowerment and Development (SPEED)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. (Ven.) Athuraliye Rathana Thero, M.P.\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\nPrice : Rs. 24.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1 Institute of Sport for Peace, Education,Empowerment and Development (SPEED) (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE INSTITUTE OF SPORT FOR PEACE,EDUCATION, EMPOWERMENT AND DEVELOPMENT (SPEED)\n\nWHEREAS an Institute called and known as the\u201cInstitute of Sport for Peace, Education, Empowerment andDevelopment (SPEED) \u201d has heretofore been established inSri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out itsobjects and transacting all matters connected with the saidInstitute according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Institute has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Institute of Sport forPeace, Education, Empowerment and Development(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2021."
  },
