    "chunk_size_bytes": 1552,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. Sarathi Dushmantha, M. P.for Kegalle District on 03rd of August 2021\n\n(Published in the Gazette on July 19, 2021)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nBALANGODA ANANDA MAITREYA FOUNDATION\n\n(INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Balangoda Ananda Maitreya Foundation\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 62]\n\n1Balangoda Ananda Maitreya Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nShort title\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE BALANGODA ANANDA MAITREYAFOUNDATION\n\nWHERE A Foundation called and known as the \u201cBalangodaAnanda Maitreya Foundation\u201d has heretofore been formedin Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out andtransacting all objects and matters connected with the saidFoundation according to the rules agreed to by its members :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed, and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Balangoda AnandaMaitreya Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2021"
  },
