    "chunk_size_bytes": 1866,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. Anura Priyadharshana Yapa, M. P.for Kurunegala District on 03rd of August 2021\n\n(Published in the Gazette on July 19, 2021)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\nARUNDIKA FERNANDO RELIEF SERVICES ANDGODFREY FERNANDO MEMORIAL FOUNDATION\n\n(INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Arundika Fernando Relief Services andGodfrey Fernando Memorial Foundation\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 60]\n\n1Arundika Fernando Relief Services andGodfrey Fernando Memorial Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE ARUNDIKA FERNANDO RELIEFSERVICES AND GODFREY FERNANDO MEMORIAL FOUNDATION\n\nWHERE an Foundation called and known as the\u201cArundika Fernando Relief Services and Godfrey FernandoMemorial Foundation\u201d has heretofore been formed atNo. 65, Walawwaththa, Dankotuwa, of Puttalam District inSri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carring out andtransacting all objects and matters connected with the saidFoundation according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has hertoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Arundika FernandoRelief Services and Godfrey Fernando Memorial Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2021."
  },
