    "chunk_text": "(e)to advance the use of sport as a vehicle to promotehealth and prevent drug abuse through physicaleducation, foster the inclusion and well-being ofpersons with disabilities and facilitate socialinclusion of marginalized groups;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation\n\n30\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(f)to provide resources, services and facilities to enablemarginalized South Asian sports men and womento pursue and achieve excellence in sport whilealso furthering their educational and vocationalskills and other aspects of their personaldevelopment; and\n\n(g)to create a South Asian Knowledge Centre for Sportincluding research and development facilities onsports science, sports medicine, physical educationand sports engineering.\n\n(2) In the implementation of the objects specified insubsection (1) the Corporation shall ensure that suchimplementation shall be carried out without any distinctionbased on race, religion, language, caste, sex, politicalopinion, place of birth or and of such grounds.\n\n4.The objects of the Corporation shall be carried out insuch manner so as not to create any conflict between thework of the Corporation and any work being carried outsimultaneously by any Ministry or Department of theGovernment or of any Provincial Council.\n\n5.(1) Subject to the provisions of this Act, themanagement and administration of the affairs of theCorporation shall be carried out by Governig Council(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCouncil\u201d) consisting of suchnumber of office bearers as may be specified by the rulesmade under section 7.\n\n(2) (a) The Governing Council of the Insitute that holdsoffice on the day immediately preceding the date ofcommencement of this Act, shall function as the Council ofthe Corporation until the first Council is appointed or electedin the manner provided for by rules made under section 7.30\n\nCorporationto ensure noconflict withwork ofMinistry orDepartmentof theGovernmentor Province\n\nManagementof affairs oftheCorporation"
