    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of September 10, 2021\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 10.09.2021)\n\nYOUTHFUL OFFENDERS (TRAINING SCHOOLS)(AMENDMENT)\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Justice\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nto amend the Youthful Offenders (Training Schools)Ordinance (Chapter 25)\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 4 of the Youthful Offenders (Training Schools)Ordinance (Chapter 25) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and thelegal effect of the section as amended is to make the provisions of the Ordinance genderneutral.\n\nClause 3 : This clause amends section 5 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof the section as amended is to make the provisions of the Ordinance gender neutral.\n\nClause 4 : This clause amends section 16 of the principal enactment and the legaleffect of the section as amended is to redefine the expression \u201cyouthful person\u201d as aperson who has attained the age of eighteen years and who has not attained the age oftwenty two years.\n\n1Youthful Offenders (Training Schools)(Amendment)\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 27/2019\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE YOUTHFUL OFFENDERS(TRAINING SCHOOLS) ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 25)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2013\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Youthful Offenders(Training Schools) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2021 andshall come into operation on such date as the Minister mayby Order published in the Gazette appoint.\n\n2.Section 4 of the Youthful Offenders (Training Schools)Ordinance (Chapter 25) (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended in subsection (1)thereof, by the substitution for the words \u201cany male person-\u201d,of the words \u201cany person-\u201d."
