    "chunk_text": "(ii)Subsequent to the death or resignation of thesaid lay Patrons, the lay Patrons having thefollowing qualifications shall be appointed bythe executive committee consisting of thePresident of the Society for their vacant offices:-\n\n(ii) Those who have enough experiences ofthe Society and religion.\n\n(ii) Those who are educated, intelligent andrecognized by the Society.\n\n(4) (1) Board of Trustees:-\n\nAt the first executive meeting holding subsequent to theannual general meeting, a committee of office bearersconsisting of the Chairman, Vice Chairman, Secretary, thetwo Vice Secretaries, Treasurer, Vice Treasurer, Two Patronsand an executive member including the housing managershall be appointed:-\n\n(a)Board of Trustees shall act according to theinstructions of the executive committee;\n\n(b)Board of Trustees shall hold the said duty withinthe period of three (03) years;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n5Kelaniya Buddhist Women's Charitable Society\n\n(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n(c)Members of this Board shall be active members ofthe Society for more than three (03) years;\n\n(d)The Society shall have the power to transfer,mortgage, sell, develop, lease, signing in thecontracts of exchange and buy, construct buildingsand do all necessary actions for such purposes, anyrights, titles or legal rights of immovable andmovable properties where necessary.\n\n(2) Housing Committee :-\n\nSix (06) members including the housing manager can beappointed to this committee-\n\n(a)The Chairperson of the housing committee shall bean executive committee member and other membersshall hold the membership of the Society;\n\n(b)The housing committee shall perform the prescribedduty until the next annual meeting;\n\n(c)The recommendation procedure fo educaion,health, care and other needs of the daughters ofSenehasa Child Development Center atNo. 307/16, Jayamawatha, Webada, Kirillawalashall be submitted to the monthly committee;\n\n(d)The membership will be cancelled in the event ofabsence of four (04) consecutive meetings withoutnotice;"
