    "chunk_size_bytes": 1977,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sahana CommunityDevelopment Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of2021.\n\n3.(1) The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a) to conduct workshops, discussions and seminars onthe matters of educational interest;\n\nShort title\n\nPreamble\n\nIncorporationof the SahanaCommunityDevelopmentFoundation\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation\n\n25\n\n2Sahana Community Development Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b) to make provision to exhibit, improve and appreciatethe cultural talents of school children and wardcertificates to talented school children;\n\n(c) to implement a special training programme to buildup a generation of children who appreciate valuesand good conduct on practical terms;\n\n(d) to conduct leadership camps and workshops to schoolchildren to build up leadership qualities and toprovide necessary skills to equip them for practicalliving;\n\n(e) to conduct a practical programmes which developpatriotism in order to develop a generation of schoolchildren with physical capability through aprogramme of sanitation, health habits and aprogramme for sports and physical education;\n\n(f) to organize educational tours, shramadanas andworkshops, aimed at protecting Sri Lanka\u2019s heritate,environment and forestry;\n\n(g) to support and encourage the services provided bysenior citizens movements ;\n\n(h) to give full support and assistance to informal,education programmes, special educationprogrammes and elders education pragrammes ;\n\n(i) to encourage farmers engaged in traditional andexport oriented agricultural activities and to conductvarious activities to enable them to expand theirknowledge ;\n\n(j) to assist in various programmes implemented forgranting necessary facilities for the \u2018Ranaviru\u2019 ;\n\nSahana Community Development Foundation(Incorporation)3\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20"
