    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 74]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. (Ven.) Athuraliye Rathana Thero, M.P.on 06th of October, 2021\n\n(Published in the Gazette on September 27, 2021)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 24.00Postage : Rs. 15. 00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nKELANIYA BUDDHIST WOMEN\u2019S CHARITABLESOCIETY (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Kelaniya Buddhist Women\u2019s Charitable Society\n\n1Kelaniya Buddhist Women's Charitable Society\n\n(Incorporation)\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE KELANIYA BUDDHIST WOMEN'SCHARITABLE SOCIETY\n\nWHEREAS a Society called and known as the \u201cKelaniyaBuddhist Women's Charitable Society\u201d has heretofore beenestablished in Kribathgoda of Gampaha District in Sri Lankafor the purpose of effectually carrying out it's objects andtransacting all matters connected with the said Societyaccording to the rules agreed to by its members for fifty sixyears (56):\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Society has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was formed and has applied to be incorporated andit will be for the public advantage to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Kelaniya BuddhistWomen's Charitable Society (Incorporation) Act, No. of2021."
  },
