    "chunk_text": "(c)The recommendation procedure fo educaion,health, care and other needs of the daughters ofSenehasa Child Development Center atNo. 307/16, Jayamawatha, Webada, Kirillawalashall be submitted to the monthly committee;\n\n(d)The membership will be cancelled in the event ofabsence of four (04) consecutive meetings withoutnotice;\n\n5.(1) The Board shall cause to maintain a Register ofmembers including the names of persons who becamemembers of the Soiciety on the immediately perceding dateof operation of this Act and those who are duly enrolled as amember of the Corporation.\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nRegister ofmembers\n\n6Kelaniya Buddhist Women's Charitable Society\n\n(Incorporation)\n\n(2) The Register shall consist of the followinginformation:-\n\nName of the member, address, occupation, date notedin the Register, date of ceasing the membership.\n\n6.The Classification of membership are as follows:-\n\n(i)General members:- Entry fee and the monthlymembership fee shall be paid (can be paidmonthly or annually). Society Maintenancefee and the welfare fee shall be paid on adecision made at the general meeting.\n\n(ii)Life members:- Entry fees and the lifemembership fees shall be paid at once. SocietyMaintenance fees and the welfare fees shallbe paid on a decision made at the GeneralMeeting.\n\n(iii)Honorary members:- Entry fees or themembership fees will not charged. Any personwho has done a great service to the BuddhaSasana and is qualified to be a member if theSociety, is entitlied for the honorarymembership upon a resolution passed by thevotes of two third (2/3) of members. Thehonorary members shall not be more than five(05) members. The persons who are grantedthe honorary membership, are entitled formembership rights.\n\n7.Disqualifications to be a member of the executivecommittee are as follows:-\n\n(i)Not being a member of Kelaniya BuddhistWomen's Society;\n\n(ii)Not being a Buddhist;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nDisqualificationsto be amember ofexecutivecommittee\n\nClassificationofmembership"
