    "chunk_text": "7.Disqualifications to be a member of the executivecommittee are as follows:-\n\n(i)Not being a member of Kelaniya BuddhistWomen's Society;\n\n(ii)Not being a Buddhist;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nDisqualificationsto be amember ofexecutivecommittee\n\nClassificationofmembership\n\n(Incorporation)\n\n(iii)Being an unsound minded person; and\n\n(iv)Being a person who has been convicted of anoffence of moral turpitude by a competentcourt.\n\n8.(1) Subject to the provisions of this Act or any otherwritten law, in order to accomplish the objects of theCorporation, the Corporation shall have the power to -\n\n(a)(i)open, mainain and close bank accounts relatedto the Corporation;\n\n(ii)request and accept the contributions of theCorporation, grants, donations or all kinds ofaid and donations;\n\n(b)(i)open and maintain bank accounts on behalf ofthe \u201cSenehasa Child Development Center\u201d(Senehasa Dari Sewana) at No. 307/16,Jaya Mawatha, Webada, Kirillawala.\n\n(ii)request or accept donations, all kinds of aids,gifts on behalf of \u201c(Senehasa Dari Sewana) atNo. 307/16, Jaya Mawatha, Webada, Kirillawala.\n\n(c)enter into agreements or contracts with any person,any company or body corporate;\n\n(d)purchase, acquire, rent, construct or otherwise obtainland or buildings which may be required for thepurposes of the Corporation;\n\n(e)appoint, employ and dismiss necessary officers andservants; and\n\n(f)pay employee salary, allowance and gratuity as maybe datermined by the Corporation and to trainworkforce in Sri Lanka for the purposes of theCorporation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nPowers of theCorporation\n\n8Kelaniya Buddhist Women's Charitable Society\n\n(Incorporation)\n\n(2) The Corporation shall have the power to do all suchother acts or things which are necessary or appropriate topromote and enhance and to the attainment of all or any ofits objects."
