    "chunk_text": "2.(1) From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of theNalin Fernando Foundation (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as members ofthe Corporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporatewith perpetual succession, under the name and style of theNalin Fernando Foundation (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and be sued withfull power and authority to have and to use a common sealand alter the same at its pleasure.\n\nShort title\n\n10\n\nPreamble\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nIncorporationof NalinFernandoFoundation\n\n30\n\nNalin Fernando Foundation(Incorporation)2\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a) to improve mutual understanding, peacefulcoexistent, religious harmony, spiritual developmentwithin the citizens of Sri Lanka through religious,cultural, social and economic inter activities;\n\n(b) to assist financially or otherwise in order to developpersonal skills and challenges enabling to concentrateon self-employment;\n\n(c) to help by providing uniforms, instruments and textbooks for the needy students and also to grantscholarship for their secondary and tertiary education;\n\n(d) to identify fields for appropriate projects for theyouths who leave from school and also support forthem through maintaining such projects in the focusof training in order to face the competitive demandfor future employment opportunities;\n\n(e) to identify projects such as sport, music of studentsin the divisional and rural levels and motivate forimproving their simultaneous skills through bymaintaining such projects in order to face thecompetitive demand increasing for the futureemployment opportunities;\n\n(f) to provide help and subsidy to improve theirpersonality of the disabled persons;"
