    "chunk_size_bytes": 1676,
    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of October 01, 2021\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 07.10.2021)\n\nAPPROPRIATION (AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Finance\n\nto amend the Appropriation Act, No. 7 of 2020\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends paragraph (b) of subsection (1) of section 2 of theAppropriation Act, No. 7 of 2020, and the legal effect of section as amended is to increasethe borrowing limit of rupees two thousand nine hundred ninety seven billion to rupeesthree thousand three hundred ninety seven billion.\n\nAppropriation (Amendment)1\n\nShort title\n\n5\n\n10\n\nL.D. \u2013 O. 57/2021\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE APPROPRIATION ACT, NO. 7 OF 2020\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Appropriation(Amendment) Act, No.....of 2021.\n\n2.Section 2 of the Appropriation Act, No. 7 of 2020 ishereby amended in paragraph (b) of subsection (1) thereof,by the substitution for the words, \u201crupees two thousand ninehundred ninety seven billion\u201d of the words \u201crupees threethousand three hundred ninety seven billion\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between theSinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shallprevail.\n\nAmendmentof section 2of Act, No. 7of 2020\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\n2Appropriation (Amendment)\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
  },
