    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of October 15, 2021\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 18.10.2021)\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nMABOTUWANA SRI PIYARATHANANAYAKA THERO SUWASEVANAFOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Asanka Navarathna, M. P. forKurunegala District\n\nto incorporate the Mabotuwana Sri Piyarathana Nayaka TheroSuwasevana Foundation\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\n1Mabotuwana Sri Piyarathana Nayaka TheroSuwasevana Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE MABOTUWANA SRI PIYARATHANANAYAKA THERO SUWASEVANA FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS an Foundation called and known as the\u201cMabotuwana Sri Piyarathana Nayaka Thero SuwasevanaFoundation\u201d has heretofore been formed in Sri Lanka for thepurpose of effectually carrying out its objects and transactingall matters connected with the said Trust according to therules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted several objects andmatters for which it was established, and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Mabotuwana SriPiyarathana Nayaka Thero Suwasevana Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2021."
  },
