    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Labour on 22nd of October, 2021\n\n(Published in the Gazette on October 12, 2021)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 84]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nTERMINATION OF EMPLOYMENT OF WORKMEN(SPECIAL PROVISIONS) (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Termination of Employment of Workmen(Special Provisions) Act, No. 45 of 1971\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 3 of the Termination of Employment ofWorkmen (Special Provisions) Act, No. 45 of 1971 and is consequential to the provisionsintroduced by the Minimum Retirement Age of Workers Act.\n\n1Termination of Employment of Workmen(Special Provisions) (Amendment)\n\nShort title\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 31/2021\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE TERMINATION OF EMPLOYMENT OF WORKMEN(SPECIAL PROVISIONS) ACT, NO. 45 OF 1971\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Termination ofEmployment of Workmen (Special Provisions)(Amendment) Act, No. of 2021.\n\n2.Section 3 of the Termination of Employment ofWorkmen (Special Provisions) Act, No. 45 of 1971 is herebyamended in subsection (1) thereof, by the repeal of paragraph(c) and the substitution therefore of the following:-\n\n\u201c(c)to the termination of employment of anyworkman where such termination was effectedupon such workman attains the minimumretirement age as specified in the MinimumRetirement Age of Workers Act, No. of 2021;\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between theSinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shallprevail.\n\nAmendmentof section 9of Act,No. 45 of1971\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\n2Termination of Employment of Workmen(Special Provisions) (Amendment)"
  },
