    "chunk_text": "(j) to combat waste and corruption and utilize allresources belonging to our community in a veryuseful manner;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation\n\n3Ananda Aluthgamage Development, SocialServices and Charity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(l) to initiate and implement technical, industrial andcomputer vocational training institutions andprogrammes so that young men and women fromfamilies of lower social strata can gain selfemployment opportunities;\n\n(m)to provide training necessary for young men andwomen engaged in agriculture and guiding themtowards export crops cultivation, organizing localand foreign marketing activities necessary for it,and providing space necessary for cultivation;\n\n(n)to provide aids and assistance in times of naturaldisasters, emergencies and accidents;\n\n(o)to provide training in fields of engineering,technology, carpentry, masonary, driving andcomputing to young men and women who do notget qualified for higher education and directing themtowards such vocations and starting training centresnecessary for it; and\n\n(p)to do everything and else as are necessary, incidentalor conducive to the attainment of the above objectsor serveral of them.\n\n4.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts and matters as necessary ordesirable for the promotion or furtherance of the objects ofthe Corporation or any one of them, including the power\u2014\n\n(a)to raise funds and receive grants, gifts or donations,in cash or kind;\n\nPowers of theCorporation\n\n4Ananda Aluthgamage Development, SocialServices and Charity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n(b)to acquire, in any manner whatsoever and hold,take or give on lease or hire, rent, sell or otherwisedispose of, any movable or immovable property andconstruct, maintain and alter any buildings or worksnecessary or convenient for the business of theCorporation;"
