    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by the Hon. Buddhika Pathirana, M.P.for Matara District on 10th of November, 2021\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 90]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on October 04, 2021)\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSAHANA COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENTFOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Sahana Community Development Foundation\n\nSahana Community Development Foundation(Incorporation)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SAHANA COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENTFOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS an Foundation called and known as the \u201cSahanaCommunity Development Foundation\u201d has heretofore beenformed in for the purpose of effectually carrying out andtransacating the objects and matters connected with the saidFoundation according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe said application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sahana CommunityDevelopment Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of2021."
