    "md5": "9c8e90249c07ed5277718b85d8de5da5",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1924,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Ananda AluthgamageDevelopment, Social Services and Charity Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2021.\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\nIncorporationof theAnandaAluthgamageDevelopment,SocialServices andCharityFoundation\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2Ananda Aluthgamage Development, SocialServices and Charity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a) to provide medical aid and food to the poor, thedestitute and the sick;\n\n(b) to conduct special services for needy school childrenand to offer assistance by way of scholarships, libraryfacilities and other necessary support for students;\n\n(c) to conduct classes for the students sitting for YearFive Scholarship, GCE (O/L) and GCE (A/L)examinations by experts in the particular field ofeducation;\n\n(d) to support and encourage the service facilitiesrendered by senior citizens organizations;\n\n(e) to work for the development of pre-schools for theearly childhood development of needy children;\n\n(f) to give aid by way of scholarships to any officer orservant engaged in the furtherance of the objects ofthe Corporation;\n\n(g) to promote co-operation and friendship with similarinstitutions within and outside Sri Lanka;\n\n(h) to organize employees of small and medium scaleindustries and enterprises and working towards theirfuture advancement;\n\n(i) to initiate and implement economic, social, culturaland environmental development activities inSri Lanka and providing guidance necessary for it;\n\n(j) to combat waste and corruption and utilize allresources belonging to our community in a veryuseful manner;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation\n\n3Ananda Aluthgamage Development, SocialServices and Charity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
  },
