    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Centre for SkillsDevelopment Studies (Incorporation) Act, No. of2021.\n\n3.(1) The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to promote education in Skills Development at alllevel;\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title\n\nIncorporationof the Centre\n\nfor Skills\n\nDevelopment\n\nStudies\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation\n\n2Centre for Skills Development Studies(Incorporation)\n\n(b)to conduct motivation programmes to encourageschool children;\n\n(c)to provide self-employment opportunities forunemployed;\n\n(d)to conduct and hold training, seminars, conferencesand similar activities for the purpose of promotinglegal profession and Skills Development courses;\n\n(e)to establish information technology centers for theadvancement of scientific studies;\n\n(f)to assist in the development of educational,religious, cultural, aesthetic and sports facilitieswithout any deference to race, religion or cast;\n\n(g)to assist students who prepare for law entranceexaminations by conducting lecture series, seminarsand study of tours; and\n\n(h)to liaise and co-ordinate with other local and foreigninstitutions which have similar objects.\n\n4.(1) The affairs of the body corporate shall, subject tothe other provisions of this Act and the rules in force for thetime being of the body corporate be administered by aCommittee of Management consisting of Chairman,Secretary, Treasurer another two members elected inaccordance with such rules.\n\n(2) The first Committee of Management shall consist ofthe members of the Governors Board holding office on theday immediately preceding the date of commencement ofthis Act.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nManagementof the Affairsof the bodycorporate\n\n3Centre for Skills Development Studies(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
