    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of December 24, 2021\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 27.12.2021)\n\nPROHIBITION OF OBSCENE PUBLICATIONS\n\nBILL\n\nto prohibit the publication, distribution, sale, import and export of anymatter, object or thing which is obscene; to repeal the Obscene PublicationsOrdinance (Chapter 30); and to provide for matters connected therewithor incidental thereto\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Justice\n\nPrice : Rs. 30.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nProhibition of Obscene Publications1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nShort title\n\nL.D.-O. 21/2007\n\nAN ACT TO PROHIBIT THE PUBLICATION, DISTRIBUTION, SALE, IMPORT\n\nAND EXPORT OF ANY MATTER, OBJECT OR THING WHICH IS OBSCENE;\n\nTO REPEAL THE OBSCENE PUBLICATIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 30);\n\nAND TO PROVIDE FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL\n\nTHERETO.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Prohibition of ObscenePublications Act, No. of 2021.\n\nPART I\n\nAPPLICATION OF THE ACT\n\n2.The provisions of this Act shall apply where\u2013\n\n(a)any act which constitutes an offence under this Acttakes place in Sri Lanka irrespective of whether theperson who commits such offence is in Sri Lanka ornot;\n\n(b)a person commits an offence under this Act inSri Lanka, while in Sri Lanka; or\n\n(c)an offence under this Act, wherever committed, iscommitted by a person who is a citizen of Sri Lanka.\n\nPART II\n\nOBSCENE PUBLICATIONS\n\n3.(1) A person shall not\u2013\n\n(a)publish, exhibit, let on hire, sell, offer for sale,distribute or in any manner introduce into\n\nPublishing&c. ofobscenematter, objector thing, anoffence\n\nApplicationof the Act\n\n2Prohibition of Obscene Publications\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\ncirculation through any medium of communicationany matter, object or thing which is obscene;"
