    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 100]\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Wildlife and Forest Conservationon 20th of January, 2022\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 19, 2021)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nBILL\n\nA\n\nFAUNA AND FLORA PROTECTION(AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Fauna and Flora Protection Ordinance(Chapter 469)\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause replaces the long title to the Fauna and Flora Protection Ordinance(Chapter 469) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect ofthe amendment is to expand the scope of the principal enactment.\n\nClause 3: This clause amends section 71 of the principal enactment and the legaleffect as amended is to empower the Minister to make regulations in order to give effectto the Convention on International Trade in Endangered Species of Wild Fauna and Flora(CITES).\n\n1Fauna and Flora Protection (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nShort title\n\nReplacementof the LongTitle to(Chapter 469)\n\n25\n\nL. D.\u2014 O. 13/2017\n\nAN ACT TO THE FAUNA AND FLORA PROTECTION ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 469)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Fauna and FloraProtection (Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.\n\n2. The long title to the Fauna and Flora ProtectionOrdinance (Chapter 469) (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby repealed and the followinglong title substituted therefor:\u2014"
