    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nCODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDURE(AMENDMENT)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Justice on 10th of March, 2022\n\n(Published in the Gazette on February 11, 2022)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 109]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nto amend the Code of Criminal Procedure Act, No. 15 of 1979\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends section 442 of the Code of Criminal ProcedureAct, No. 15 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legaleffect of the amendment is to make provision to issue one certified copy of the judgmentor final order of the record to each of the parties to the case free of charge.\n\nClause 3: This clause amends section 443 of the principal enactment and isconsequential to the amendment made by clause 2.\n\n1Code of Criminal Procedure (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nShort title\n\nReplacementof section442 of Act,No. 15 of1979\n\n25\n\nL. D.\u2013O. 45/2017\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDUREACT, NO. 15 OF 1979\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Code of CriminalProcedure (Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.\n\n2. Section 442 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act,No. 15 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby repealed and the following section issubstituted therefor: -"
