    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Agriculture on 24th of March, 2022\n\n(Published in the Gazette on February 07, 2022)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 48.00Postage : Rs. 35.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 110]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nBILL\n\nA\n\nANIMAL WELFARE\n\nto provide for Animal Welfare and to prevent cruelty to Animals; to repealthe prevention of cruelty to Animals Ordinance (Chapter 475); and formatters connected therewith or incidental thereto\n\nAnimal Welfare1\n\n5\n\nL.D.\u2013O. 5/2016\n\nAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR ANIMAL WELFARE AND TO PREVENT CRUELTY\n\nTO ANIMALS; TO REPEAL THE PREVENTION OF CRUELTY TO ANIMALS\n\nORDINANCE (CHAPTER 475); AND FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH\n\nOR INCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Animal Welfare Act,No. of 2022.\n\n2.The objects of this Act shall be to\u2013\n\n(a) foster kindness, compassion and responsiblebehavior towards animals and secure theprotection, welfare and wellbeing of animals;and\n\n(b) protect animals from cruelty.\n\nPART I\n\nCHAPTER I\n\nCruelty to Animals\n\n3.(1) A person shall not\u2013\n\n(a) beat, kick, override, overload, overwork, over-walk, overbreed, torture, terrify or otherwisetreat an animal so as to subject it to unnecessarypain or, being a person in charge of an animal,permit the animal to be so treated;\n\n(b) use an animal in any work or labour or for anyother purpose for which by reason of anydisease, infirmity, wound, or other cause, such\n\nShort title\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nObjects ofthe Act\n\nOffence ofcruelty toanimals\n\n2Animal Welfare\n\nanimal is unfit to be so used or being the personin charge of the animal, permit any such unfitanimal to be so used;"
