    "chunk_size_bytes": 1358,
    "chunk_text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDUREACT, NO. 15 OF 1979\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Code of CriminalProcedure (Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.\n\n3. Section 286 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the substitution for the words and figures, \u201cInthis section and in section 288 the expression\u201d of the words\u201cIn this section the expression\u201d.\n\n4. Section 288 of the principal enactment is herebyrepealed and the following section is substituted therefor:\u2013\n\n288. When any person has been sentencedunder section 53 of the Penal Code(Chapter 19), such person shall be detained inan institution established under any writtenlaw for the detention of persons under the ageof eighteen years, for a period specified in thesentence and subject to the provisions of suchwritten law.\u201d.\n\n\u201cExecutionof sentencesunder section53 of thePenal Code(Chapter 19)\n\nReplacementof section288 of theprincipalenactment\n\nAmendmentof section286 of theprincipalenactment\n\n25\n\nCode of Criminal Procedure (Amendment)2\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\n5. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand the Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\n3Code of Criminal Procedure (Amendment)\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
