    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by the Prime Minister and Minister of Economic Policies & PlanImplementation, Minister of Buddhasasana, Religious & Cultural Affairsand Minister of Urban Development & Housing on 08th of April, 2022\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 114]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on March 25, 2022)\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nINDUSTRIAL DISPUTES (SPECIAL PROVISIONS)\n\nto make special provisions to deem the Presidents of the labour tribunals asAdditional Magistrates to hear, try, determine and dispose of all suits orprosecutions under the provisions of specified enactments and for matters connected therewith or incidental thereto\n\nIndustrial Disputes (Special Provisions)1\n\nL.D.-O. 22/2020\n\nAN ACT TO MAKE SPECIAL PROVISIONS TO DEEM THE PRESIDENTS\n\nOF THE LABOUR TRIBUNALS AS ADDITIONAL MAGISTRATES\n\nTO HEAR, TRY, DETERMINE AND DISPOSE OF ALL SUITS OR\n\nPROSECUTIONS UNDER THE PROVISIONS OF SPECIFIED\n\nENACTMENTS AND FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR\n\nINCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Industrial Disputes(Special Provisions) Act, No. of 2022 and shall comeinto operation on such date as the Minister may, inconsultation with the Minister assigned the subject of Justice,appoint by Order published in the Gazette."
