    "chunk_text": "(vii)to determine scales of Professional Feesand conditions of engagement forBuilding Services Engineers andTechnologists, within Sri Lanka;\n\n(viii)to liaise with Institutions/Associations ofBuilding Services Engineers andTechnologists in other countries;\n\n(x)to create a forum for Building ServicesEngineers and Technologists to expresstheir opinion, share their knowledge,enhance presentation skills and to promotefellowship;\n\n(xi)to promote the general advancement ofBuilding Services as a Science, and as aProfession;\n\n(xii)to facilitate the exchange of informationand ideas on subjects of BuildingServices, amongst the members of theInstitution;\n\n(xiii)to hold and to conduct, supervise andcontrol the admission, professionaleducation and training of persons desiringto qualify as Professional BuildingServices Engineers and Technologists;\n\nInstitution of Building Services Engineering &Technology of Sri Lanka (Incorporation)4\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(xiv)to prescribe or approve courses of studyfor qualifiying examinations formembership of the Institution;\n\n(xv)to prescribe the qualifications formembership of the Institution;\n\n(xvi)to set guidelines for those desiring toqualify as Building Services Engineersand Technologists;\n\n(xvii)to establish a path for the professionalgrowth of members through ContinuousProfessional Development programms;\n\n(xviii)to educate and enlighten the public onBuilding Services Engineering andTechnology and modes of obtaining ofrelevant professional services;\n\n(xix)to establish and maintain libraries of books,standards and codes of practice,publications, manuscripts, catalogues;\n\n(xx)to establish and maintain a museum ofequipment, apparatus and material relatedto Building Services Engineering andTechnology on an on-going basis;\n\n(xxi)to hold and promote exhibitions of alliedmaterials, processes, instruments,equipments and apparatus, connected toBuilding Services Engineering andTechnology;"
