    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Jayamaga Development,Social Services and Charity Foundation (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2022.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\nShort title\n\nPreamble\n\nIncorporationof theJayamagaDevelopment,SocialServices andCharityFoundation\n\n25\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation\n\n2Jayamaga Development, Social Services andCharity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(a) to support and encourage the services provided bysenior citizens movements;\n\n(b) to give aid by way of scholarships to any officer orservants engaged in the furtherance of the objects ofthe Corporation;\n\n(c) to promote understanding, co-operation andfriendship with similar institutions within and outsideSri Lanka;\n\n(d) to organize employees of small and medium scaleindustries and enterprises and working towards theirfuture advancement;\n\n(e) to design and implement social mobilizationprogrammes for the development of children andwomen and implementing education and trainingprogrammes for this purpose;\n\n(f) to provide training in fields of engineering,technology, carpentry, driving and computing toyoung men and women who do not get access forhigher education and directing them towards suchvocations and starting training centres necessary forit; and\n\n(g) to do all such other acts and things as are necessaryfor, and incidental or conducive to the attainment ofthe above objects.\n\n4.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts and matters as necessaryor desirable for the promotion or furtherance of the objectsof the Corporation or any one of them, including the power\u2014\n\nPowers of theCorporation\n\nJayamaga Development, Social Services andCharity Foundation (Incorporation)3\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25"
